        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:healthy#e-8770176df79be6e2",
          "text": "Levine and his research team selected volunteers aged between 45 and 64 who did not exercise much but were otherwise healthy.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2022-ii",
            "paperTitle": "2022年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（新高考全国Ⅱ卷）英语",
