          "text": "Curtin is CEO of DC Central Kitchen in Washington, D.C., which recovers food and turns it into healthy meals.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2022-i",
            "paperTitle": "2022年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试英语（新高考Ⅰ卷）",
