          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:healthy#e-8f880a12726a781c",
          "text": "The program aims to help students develop science skills, environmental awareness, and healthy lifestyles.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2023-ii",
            "paperTitle": "2023年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试英语（新课标Ⅱ卷）",
